==In the TCG==
[[File:EriTemporalForces210.jpg|200px|thumb|Special illustration rare print of Eri]]
{{main|Eri (Temporal Forces 146)}}
'''Eri''' was introduced as a {{TCG|Supporter card}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]] during the English Scarlet & Violet Series (the Japanese Scarlet & Violet Era). It was first released in the Japanese {{TCG|Wild Force}} expansion and the English {{TCG|Temporal Forces}} expansion, with artwork by [[GOSSAN]]. An {{TCG|ultra rare}} version with artwork by the same illustrator and a {{TCG|special illustration rare}} version of the card illustrated by [[DOM]] were released in the same sets. It allows players to look at their opponent's hand and discard up to 2 {{TCG|Item card}}s from it.
